# Lands don't count toward "ten nonland permanents". Bot1 builds the Citadel as in the sacrifice-ten scenario but plays
# a Swamp off the top of the library as well as three Ornithopters: that is nine nonland permanents (five Moxen, the Citadel,
# three Ornithopters) and a land, so the attempted activation is reversed. A fourth Ornithopter makes ten and the same
# ability is offered and used (the positive control); the Swamp is not sacrificed.

